Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.30,H_fil,,0,0,0,,"May SYSTEM ako." Wala pang naniniwala sa kanya...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.30,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.99,S_fil,,0,0,0,,May SYSTEM ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,System?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.62,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Secret military system galing abroad,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:05.74,S_fil,,0,0,0,,o sarili mong gawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.68,S_fil,,0,0,0,,na tinititigan ng mga bansa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.62,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:08.56,S_fil,,0,0,0,,SYSTEM na talaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:09.50,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Yung sa mga web novel —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.86,S_fil,,0,0,0,,check-in ka, may supercar at mansion ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:11.80,S_fil,,0,0,0,,skill points,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.46,S_fil,,0,0,0,,yung gagawin kang superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:17.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bakit kayo tumatawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.92,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Trained professional ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.36,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kahit gaano kakatawa, hindi ako tatawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:22.86,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ibig mong sabihin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.84,S_fil,,0,0,0,,may system kang gano'n.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:24.78,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.72,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sumulpot bigla no'ng isang buwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:26.72,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pero sobrang buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:27.84,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Madaming garbled text.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mga mission nito, kakaiba lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kapag tapos ang mission, may reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.20,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Noong una, pinapalakas ang katawan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pero hindi ko mapatunayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:34.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Eh kapag bigo sa mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.18,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kapag bigo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.56,S_fil,,0,0,0,,papamatay niya ako pati pamilya ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.49,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Persecution delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:40.43,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Wala na, hayaan na.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.30,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Palamigin muna siya.
